  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>(20 fotos) Francesc Godall Del Sol&nbsp;ha sido el ganador del premio de la campa&ntilde;a de verano de Onda Centre Comercial (OCC). Consiste en una noche para dos personas con pensi&oacute;n completa en el hotel 5 estrellas Marina d&rsquo;Or, con entradas para el balneario.</p>\n<p>El sorteo se ha realizado la noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la Caja Rural, entre los miles de papeletas que la clientela de OCC fue rellenando desde el 20 de junio al 25 de julio y depositando en las urnas que hab&iacute;a en los propios comercios. Godall sell&oacute; su boleto en la Ferreter&iacute;a Salvia.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_0930.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La peque&ntilde;a Anna Villar Mart&iacute; ha sido la encargada de extraer la papeleta ganadora y otra de reserva, ante la presenci de su madre, Ana mart&iacute; Olucha, nueva presidenta de OCC y Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n Cameselle, su secretario general.</p>\n<p>Este viernes, a las 20.30 horas, tambi&eacute;n en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la Caja Rural (entrada por la calle la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute;), se le entregar&aacute; el premio a Francesc Godall Del Sol.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0914.jpg\" alt=\"img_0914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0916.jpg\" alt=\"img_0916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0917.jpg\" alt=\"img_0917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0918.jpg\" alt=\"img_0918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0920.jpg\" alt=\"img_0920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0921.jpg\" alt=\"img_0921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0922.jpg\" alt=\"img_0922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0923.jpg\" alt=\"img_0923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0924.jpg\" alt=\"img_0924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0925.jpg\" alt=\"img_0925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0926.jpg\" alt=\"img_0926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0927.jpg\" alt=\"img_0927\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0928.jpg\" alt=\"img_0928\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0930.jpg\" alt=\"img_0930\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0931.jpg\" alt=\"img_0931\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0932.jpg\" alt=\"img_0932\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0933.jpg\" alt=\"img_0933\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0934.jpg\" alt=\"img_0934\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0935.jpg\" alt=\"img_0935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyaestiu16occ/img_0936.jpg\" alt=\"img_0936\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
